License
=======

This repository holds two different kinds of work, and they are licensed
separately. Replacing the "Erik Karlgren Domercq" below is the only edit this file needs.

  Source code
  -----------
  index.html, style.css

      MIT License -- see LICENSE-MIT

  Written content
  ---------------
  The prose in index.html, and any articles added later

      Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
      (CC BY-SA 4.0) -- see LICENSE-CC-BY-SA-4.0

In plain words
--------------

  Code: you may copy, modify and reuse it for anything, including commercial
  projects, as long as the copyright notice stays with it.

  Writing: you may quote, republish or adapt it, including commercially, as
  long as you credit the author and license your version under the same
  terms.

  Copyright (c) 2026 Erik Karlgren Domercq.

The two files named above contain the actual license texts. This page is a
summary to save you reading them, not a replacement for them.
